<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第四幕 · 你写哪类程序</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>自己组装不等于从零写 —— 借力，但把边界留在自己手里</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "row", gap: 24, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{width: 400, flexDirection: "column", gap: 12, justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 16, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", height: 96}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>执行后端</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8}}>它跑在哪、能碰什么</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 16, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", height: 96}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>工具集</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8}}>它能调用什么</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 16, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", height: 96}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>门禁</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8}}>什么情况必须拦下</Text></Box><Box style={{flexDirection: "column", padding: 16, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center", height: 96}}><Text style={{fontSize: 24, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23"}}>事件流</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.5, marginTop: 8}}>每一步记在哪</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 24, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", borderRadius: 8, justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56"}}>这四样都不用从零写</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12}}>开源 harness 已经把现成实现摆在那儿了。Pi 把三层 seam（执行后端 / 工具集 / 行为组合）放在「会变的地方」，统一注入点，in-process 护栏（two-phase binding · fail-safe · fail-closed）——轻，接缝在你手上；DSH 把「可改」做成架构属性、把会话日志做成唯一依据——重，但边界你能改。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 12}}>借力换的是时间：不用重新造轮子，但你要能回答「这四样各自归谁管」。</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 19, color: "#8A5A00", lineHeight: 1.6, marginTop: 16}}>〔边界〕它没有默认沙箱、没有 MCP/ACP、没有扩展 API 版本契约——正确口径：不是说它不安全，是说它把信任放在「谁装了它」，而不是「它是什么代码」上。</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>30 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
